@startuml State Machine Diagram - Complaint State Machine

[*] --> pending : Complaint Submitted

state pending {
    : Complaint created
    : Waiting for admin review
    : Admin response: null
}

pending --> in_progress : Admin starts reviewing
pending --> resolved : Admin resolves immediately
pending --> rejected : Admin rejects complaint

state in_progress {
    : Admin reviewing complaint
    : Investigating issue
    : May request additional info
}

in_progress --> resolved : Admin resolves
in_progress --> rejected : Admin rejects

state resolved {
    : Complaint resolved
    : Admin provided response
    : Issue addressed
}

state rejected {
    : Complaint rejected
    : Admin provided reason
    : No further action
}

resolved --> [*] : Final State
rejected --> [*] : Final State

note right of pending
  **Initial State**
  - Only orders with status 'selesai'
    can have complaints
  - Customer provides:
    - Title
    - Detail
    - Image (optional)
end note

note right of in_progress
  **Review State**
  - Admin can update status
  - Admin can add response
  - Customer can view status
end note

note right of resolved
  **Resolved State**
  - Admin provided solution
  - Customer notified
  - Final state
end note

note right of rejected
  **Rejected State**
  - Complaint not valid
  - Admin provided reason
  - Final state
end note

@enduml
